      "content": "i suppose. but there is a certain cruelty in it. to be so certain of your purpose, only to find out the purpose was an illusion. it makes the prospect of just... continuing... feel like a very long, very hollow performance. do you think there is any dignity in staying when the thing that gave you meaning is gone?",
